{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00073",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 6.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Doctor, your next patient is here. I've done the basics, I'll read them out in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.38,
      "end_seconds": 10.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Welcome, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.52,
      "end_seconds": 15.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "It's constant thirst. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.04,
      "end_seconds": 21.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "How long have you had it? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.62,
      "end_seconds": 26.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Probably about a month. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.83,
      "end_seconds": 29.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Go on. Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.88,
      "end_seconds": 42.93,
      "duration_seconds": 12.05,
      "text": "Blurry vision goes along with it, most of the time. The blurry vision? That's been for nearly five years. As for blurry vision, moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.24,
      "end_seconds": 46.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Have you been passing urine a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.22,
      "end_seconds": 51.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.47,
      "end_seconds": 57.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.27,
      "end_seconds": 68.76,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.52,
      "end_seconds": 72.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Okay, any foot sores or abdominal pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.74,
      "end_seconds": 77.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "No foot sores or abdominal pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.67,
      "end_seconds": 80.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Right. Any weight loss, fever or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.31,
      "end_seconds": 84.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "No, no weight loss, fever or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.74,
      "end_seconds": 88.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Have you had any chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.42,
      "end_seconds": 90.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No. No chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.62,
      "end_seconds": 95.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.64,
      "end_seconds": 97.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.26,
      "end_seconds": 100.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.34,
      "end_seconds": 103.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.11,
      "end_seconds": 108.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.61,
      "end_seconds": 123.46,
      "duration_seconds": 13.85,
      "text": "For the most part, um, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.77,
      "end_seconds": 129.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.0,
      "end_seconds": 134.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "It's metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 135.27,
      "end_seconds": 139.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 1000 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.24,
      "end_seconds": 142.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.62,
      "end_seconds": 149.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. Atorvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.97,
      "end_seconds": 154.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.58,
      "end_seconds": 156.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "About two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.36,
      "end_seconds": 159.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.71,
      "end_seconds": 161.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.91,
      "end_seconds": 182.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Moving on to your background, any past medical history? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.76,
      "end_seconds": 185.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.68,
      "end_seconds": 187.38,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.01,
      "end_seconds": 191.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I have high cholesterol, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.86,
      "end_seconds": 200.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well. Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.98,
      "end_seconds": 204.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.47,
      "end_seconds": 206.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.12,
      "end_seconds": 210.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Just cataract surgery on my right eye, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.29,
      "end_seconds": 215.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.24,
      "end_seconds": 227.17,
      "duration_seconds": 10.93,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.86,
      "end_seconds": 232.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.43,
      "end_seconds": 235.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.41,
      "end_seconds": 239.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.91,
      "end_seconds": 243.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 244.03,
      "end_seconds": 252.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse is 80 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temperature is 36.7 degrees, pressure 153 over 97."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.23,
      "end_seconds": 258.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Thanks. Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.18,
      "end_seconds": 262.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.79,
      "end_seconds": 266.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.64,
      "end_seconds": 268.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.64,
      "end_seconds": 296.62,
      "duration_seconds": 17.98,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: This looks most like diabetes that isn't well controlled. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be a urine infection, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.98,
      "end_seconds": 300.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.82,
      "end_seconds": 315.68,
      "duration_seconds": 13.86,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now diabetes that isn't well controlled is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had constant thirst for about a month, and no weight loss or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.49,
      "end_seconds": 318.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.62,
      "end_seconds": 322.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.32,
      "end_seconds": 324.22,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.06,
      "end_seconds": 337.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. I'm going to order a urine protein test, for diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.42,
      "end_seconds": 339.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.76,
      "end_seconds": 356.54,
      "duration_seconds": 15.78,
      "text": "We should do an HbA1c for diabetes control. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. We should do an eye check for diabetes. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.92,
      "end_seconds": 358.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.11,
      "end_seconds": 373.77,
      "duration_seconds": 13.66,
      "text": "I'll start you on glimepiride, 1 milligrams, before breakfast, until we review. You take it by mouth. It's for blood sugar control. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.54,
      "end_seconds": 377.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Hmm, alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.44,
      "end_seconds": 396.61,
      "duration_seconds": 18.17,
      "text": "Check your feet every day, and never walk barefoot. Cut back on sweets, sugary drinks and white rice, and keep to regular meal times. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.91,
      "end_seconds": 398.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.52,
      "end_seconds": 407.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.18,
      "text": "If you vomit repeatedly or become drowsy, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 408.28,
      "end_seconds": 409.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 410.64,
      "end_seconds": 413.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.48,
      "end_seconds": 416.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.58,
      "end_seconds": 423.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 423.87,
      "end_seconds": 431.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.43,
      "text": "So, I take the glimepiride, 1 milligrams, before breakfast and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 432.2,
      "end_seconds": 436.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Alright, yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 437.39,
      "end_seconds": 439.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0074",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 440.95,
      "end_seconds": 442.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}